               step("s10", "Measure two optimisations", "Pick two: (1) explicit schema vs inferSchema, (2) broadcast join vs a forced sort-merge join (disable with `spark.sql.autoBroadcastJoinThreshold=-1`), (3) `cache()` a DataFrame used by two actions, (4) fewer shuffle partitions. Record time before and after, and the Spark UI stage/shuffle sizes at `http://localhost:4040`."),
